OL,4,BRochdale sack boss Watson after        
OL,5,BNorthampton defeat                     
OL,6,GRochdale have sacked head coach Ian    
OL,7,GWatson after only five months in       
OL,8,Gcharge of the League Two club.         
OL,10,FThe former South Shields boss replaced 
OL,11,Fpromotion-winning manager Jimmy        
OL,12,FMcNulty in June after he joined        
OL,13,FStockport but leaves the club just two 
OL,14,Fpoints clear of the relegation zone.   
OL,16,FWatson took South Shields to the       
OL,17,FNational League North play-off final   
OL,18,Flast season where they were beaten by  
OL,19,FKidderminster Harriers before taking   
OL,20,Fup his first Football League role at   
OL,21,FSpotland.                              
